trait-category-lagomorph = Adaptations

trait-stamsurge-name = Stamina Surge
trait-stamsurge-desc = You have the ability to kick your metabolism into overdrive, allowing you to rapidly recover from stamina damage at the cost of hunger.

trait-zoomies-name = Zoomies!!
trait-zoomies-desc = Your powerful legs allow you to sprint at blistering speeds for a short while, at the cost of rapidly depleting your body's water supply.

trait-lagohop-name = Bunny Hop
trait-lagohop-desc = Your springlike step allow you to hop freely this way and that, although you can't constantly do it due to the stress it places on your body.

trait-lagoears-name = All Ears
trait-lagoears-desc= You are REALLY good at listening in to voices around you. You can pick up whispers through the wall, distant voices, and secrets with ease.